# Glistening Deluge gives every creature -1/-1 and creatures that are green and/or white a further -2/-2, until end of
# turn. Bot1's green Sentinel (3/4) becomes 0/1 (-3/-3 total, the green one is not spared as Bot1's own), Bot2's white
# True Believer (2/2) dies to -3 though -1 alone would not kill it, and Bot2's colorless Ornithopter (0/2) gets only the
# -1/-1 (-1/1) and lives: the other side's non-green non-white creature is spared the extra -2/-2. The effect ends at
# cleanup (CR 514.2): Sentinel is a 3/4 again on Bot2's turn. Cost is {1}{B}{B}: with only two Moxen out on turn 1 it cannot be cast.

